    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>参考内容：<br><a href="https://hexo.io/">Hexo官网</a><br><a href="https://hexo.io/docs/">官方文档</a><br><a href="https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html">使用问题</a><br><a href="https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues">GitHub Issues</a></p><h2 id="一、前期准备（必须安装的环境）"><a href="#一、前期准备（必须安装的环境）" class="headerlink" title="一、前期准备（必须安装的环境）"></a>一、前期准备（必须安装的环境）</h2><p>1、Node.js（Hexo依赖）</p><ul><li>去官网下载合适的LTS版本：<a href="https://nodejs.org/">https://nodejs.org</a> 建议使用18版本以上。</li><li>具体安装使用自行搜索，安装完成后打开终端进行验证：</li></ul><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">node</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-v</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>2、Git安装</p><ul><li>官网：<a href="https://git-scm.com/">https://git-scm.com</a></li><li>安装后验证：<code>git --version</code></li></ul><p>3、<a href="#my-anchor">github账号</a></p><ul><li>如果没有则先注册一个，记住你账户的用户名，<code>${username}.github.io</code>就是你的个人站点。<a href="#my-anchor">点击这里跳转到仓库创建</a></li></ul><h2 id="二、-全局安装Hexo命令行工具"><a href="#二、-全局安装Hexo命令行工具" class="headerlink" title="二、 全局安装Hexo命令行工具"></a>二、 全局安装Hexo命令行工具</h2><p>由于国内的网络问题，因此推荐使用<code>pnpm</code>，如果没有安装，也可以直接将<code>pnpm</code>替换为<code>npm</code>。</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">npm</span> i <span class="token parameter variable">-g</span> <span class="token function">pnpm</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>1、全局安装Hexo命令行工具并验证</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">pnpm</span> i <span class="token parameter variable">-g</span> hexo-cli<span class="token comment"># 有时候win下需要重启终端</span>hexo <span class="token parameter variable">-v</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>2、创建博客目录并初始化</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">hexo init blog<span class="token builtin class-name">cd</span> blog<span class="token function">pnpm</span> <span class="token function">install</span> <span class="token comment"># 如果安装失败，并提示Run "pnpm approve-builds" to pick which dependencies should be allowed to run scripts.直接运行</span><span class="token function">pnpm</span> approve-builds<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>解释：hexo init会在执行命令的文件夹中生成标准的Hexo目录结构，使用pnpm安装依赖。</p><p>3、本地预览</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">hexo server <span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>浏览器直接访问<code>http://localhost:4000</code>，可以看到默认的landscape主题就安装成功了。</p><p><img src="/images/%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/1787106844625.png" alt="landscape主题图"></p><h2 id="三、安装并启用-Matery-主题"><a href="#三、安装并启用-Matery-主题" class="headerlink" title="三、安装并启用 Matery 主题"></a>三、安装并启用 Matery 主题</h2><p>1、下载主题</p><blockquote><p>推荐 git clone，方便后续更新，也可以直接去github上下载</p></blockquote><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token builtin class-name">cd</span> themes<span class="token function">git</span> clone https://github.com/blinkfox/hexo-theme-matery.git<span class="token comment"># 重命名为更短的名字</span><span class="token function">mv</span> hexo-theme-matery matery<span class="token builtin class-name">cd</span> <span class="token punctuation">..</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>2、修改hexo配置，启用matery</p><p>打开blog目录下的<code>_config.yml</code>文件，找到<code>theme:</code>一行，改为：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-text" data-language="text"><code class="language-text"># 和上面文件夹的名称保持一致theme: matery<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>想要做什么修改，具体配置的内容参考官方文档：<code>https://hexo.io/zh-cn/docs/configuration.html#%E7%BD%91%E7%AB%99</code></p><p>例如修改语言为中文：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-text" data-language="text"><code class="language-text">language: zh-CN<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>3、创建主题需要的页面</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">hexo new page categorieshexo new page tagshexo new page about<span class="token comment"># 可选</span>hexo new page friendshexo new page contact<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>然后编辑对应文件，即将layout与matery中对应上，下面是about的修改，其他的几个创建的页面也同理：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-text" data-language="text"><code class="language-text">---title: aboutdate: 2024-06-01 16:22:00type: "about"layout: "about"---<span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>这个hexo new命令只是在source目录下创建了一个文件夹，并创建了一个index.md文件，在hexo的规则中，source文件夹下的任何index.md最终都会生成一个独立的HTML网页，路径就是文件夹的名字，比如about/index.md 最终的访问地址就是 localhost:4000/about，具体这个页面的渲染是依赖matery主题，在主题文件夹中也有_config.yml配置文件，搜索<code>menu</code>就会看到具体的路由配置，如果没有在hexo的source中创建对应的文件夹，当跳转的时候就会提示404页面。具体该页面的渲染内容，例如about页面，则是在matery中的layout下about.ejs中。</p><p>4、目录中的代码高亮配置：</p><p>5、推荐安装的插件：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">pnpm</span> <span class="token function">install</span> hexo-generator-search <span class="token parameter variable">--save</span>          <span class="token comment"># 站内搜索</span><span class="token function">pnpm</span> <span class="token function">install</span> hexo-wordcount <span class="token parameter variable">--save</span>                 <span class="token comment"># 字数统计</span><span class="token function">pnpm</span> <span class="token function">install</span> hexo-permalink-pinyin <span class="token parameter variable">--save</span>          <span class="token comment"># 中文链接转拼音（SEO 友好）</span><span class="token function">pnpm</span> <span class="token function">install</span> hexo-generator-feed <span class="token parameter variable">--save</span>            <span class="token comment"># RSS</span><span class="token comment"># 可选 emoji</span><span class="token function">pnpm</span> <span class="token function">install</span> hexo-filter-github-emojis <span class="token parameter variable">--save</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>6、主题个性化配置</p><p>打开 themes/matery/_config.yml，这里可以改：</p><ul><li>菜单、社交链接、头像、favicon</li><li>Banner 图片、背景图<br>评论系统（推荐 Gitalk 或 Valine）</li><li>不蒜子统计、Google Analytics 等</li><li>文章信息显示（字数、阅读时间等）</li></ul><p>7、本地预览主题效果</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">hexo cleanhexo generate   <span class="token comment"># 或 hexo g</span>hexo server     <span class="token comment"># 或 hexo s</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>访问<code>http://localhost:4000</code>查看效果。</p><h2 id="四、部署到GitHub-Pages"><a href="#四、部署到GitHub-Pages" class="headerlink" title="四、部署到GitHub Pages"></a>四、部署到GitHub Pages</h2><p>1、安装hexo部署插件</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">pnpm</span> <span class="token function">install</span> hexo-deployer-git <span class="token parameter variable">--save</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span></span></code></pre><p>2、项目配置：</p><p>在根目录<code>_config.yml</code>末尾添加（把<code>username</code>换成你的 GitHub 用户名）：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-yaml" data-language="yaml"><code class="language-yaml"><span class="token key atrule">deploy</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span>  <span class="token key atrule">type</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> git  <span class="token key atrule">repo</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> git@github.com<span class="token punctuation">:</span>username/username.github.io.git   <span class="token comment"># SSH 方式（推荐）</span>  <span class="token comment"># 或者 HTTPS：https://github.com/username/username.github.io.git</span>  <span class="token key atrule">branch</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> main   <span class="token comment"># 或者 master，看你仓库默认分支</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>3、<a id="my-anchor" name="my-anchor">在 GitHub 创建仓库</a></p><p>如果之前你已经创建，则这一步可以取消。</p><ul><li>新建仓库，名字必须是 你的用户名.github.io（例如 zhangsan.github.io）。</li><li>选择 Public，不要勾选添加 README。</li></ul><p>4、部署</p><pre class="line-numbers language-bash" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">hexo cleanhexo deploy     <span class="token comment"># 或 hexo d</span><span class="token comment"># 也可以一次搞定：hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo g &amp;&amp; hexo d</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><p>第一次可能需要输入 GitHub 账号密码（或使用 Personal Access Token）。成功后等待 1～2 分钟，访问 <code>https://你的用户名.github.io</code> 即可看到网站。</p><p>使用这种方式是相当于把源码进行编译成静态网页推送到了这个仓库，本地的源码并没有推送上去，因此还需要再把本地代码进行保存推送。</p><h2 id="五、创建博客"><a href="#五、创建博客" class="headerlink" title="五、创建博客"></a>五、创建博客</h2><h3 id="新建文章"><a href="#新建文章" class="headerlink" title="新建文章"></a>新建文章</h3><p>hexo new “文章标题”</p><h1 id="编辑-source-posts-文章标题-md"><a href="#编辑-source-posts-文章标题-md" class="headerlink" title="编辑 source/_posts/文章标题.md"></a>编辑 source/_posts/文章标题.md</h1><h3 id="生成-本地预览"><a href="#生成-本地预览" class="headerlink" title="生成 + 本地预览"></a>生成 + 本地预览</h3><p>hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo g &amp;&amp; hexo s</p><h3 id="部署上线"><a href="#部署上线" class="headerlink" title="部署上线"></a>部署上线</h3><p>hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo d</p><p>文章 Front-matter 常用字段示例（Matery 支持很多扩展）：</p><pre class="line-numbers language-yaml" data-language="yaml"><code class="language-yaml"><span class="token punctuation">---</span><span class="token key atrule">title</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> 我的第一篇文章<span class="token key atrule">date</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token datetime number">2026-08-17 10:00:00</span><span class="token key atrule">categories</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>技术<span class="token punctuation">,</span> Hexo<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token key atrule">tags</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span>博客<span class="token punctuation">,</span> Matery<span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token key atrule">img</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> /images/cover.jpg          <span class="token comment"># 特色图片</span><span class="token key atrule">top</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token boolean important">true</span>                       <span class="token comment"># 置顶</span><span class="token key atrule">cover</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token boolean important">true</span><span class="token key atrule">summary</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> 这是摘要<span class="token punctuation">...</span><span class="token punctuation">---</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-numbers-rows"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></code></pre><h2 id="六、常见问题"><a href="#六、常见问题" class="headerlink" title="六、常见问题"></a>六、常见问题</h2><ul><li>图片显示不了：把图片放在<code>source/images/</code>下，用相对路径引用。</li><li>国内访问慢：可以配合 jsDelivr、Cloudflare 或把静态资源放到国内图床/OSS。</li><li>主题更新：进入主题目录<code>git pull</code>，注意备份自己改过的<code>_config.yml</code>。</li><li>自定义域名：在<code>GitHub</code>仓库 <code>Settings</code> → <code>Pages</code> 添加域名，并在<code>source/CNAME</code>文件写上你的域名。</li><li>评论系统：本站点使用的是twikoo，具体部署参考<code>https://twikoo.js.org/quick-start.html</code></li></ul>]]>
